<ProductLayout title="About BOQ Extract | Why We Built It" description="BOQ Extract is a UK construction technology company building evidence-linked quantity takeoff that quantity surveyors can check and trust.">
  <PageHead kicker="About" title="Built to give surveyors" accent="their time back." intro="BOQ Extract is a UK construction technology company. We are building software that reads construction drawings the way an experienced surveyor does, and shows its working the way a good surveyor would." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split top">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0"><span class="kicker">Why</span><h2>The bill of quantities deserves better tools.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Every tender starts the same way: a pack of drawings, a deadline and hours of measuring. The same sheets are counted and scaled again and again by every bidder, and the numbers that come out rarely carry any record of where they came from.</p>
        <p>We think most of that work can be done by software, but only if the software is honest about what it found, what it measured and what it couldn’t decide. So BOQ Extract was built evidence-first: every quantity tied to its source, every judgement call handed to a person, and no accuracy claim made until someone independent has checked it.</p>
        <p>We are starting with the UK and NRM2, and with the fit-out trades where the readers are strongest, then expanding trade by trade and country by country with design partners who price this work every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">Principles</span><h2>How we work.</h2></div>
      <div class="cards-3">
        <article class="card"><span class="tag">01</span><h3>Show the working</h3><p>A quantity without evidence is a guess. Every line in a BOQ Extract bill can be traced to the drawing it came from.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="tag">02</span><h3>People decide</h3><p>Software measures; qualified surveyors judge, review and certify. The product is designed around that line, not around replacing it.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="tag">03</span><h3>Prove, then claim</h3><p>We publish what we can do and what we can’t yet, and we only quote accuracy that an independent QS has certified.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ProductLayout>
